<Prose title="About" description="Sabha is community chat that's familiar, small, and yours. Open source, free to use, free to leave. Built by Ashwin M. on Campfire by 37signals." label="ABOUT" heading="Sabhā (सभा)">
  <p><i>A Sanskrit word meaning an assembly, a gathering, a place where people come together.</i></p>

  <p>Communities deserve chat they can call their own — open source, self-hostable, free of subscriptions and feature bloat. Sabha keeps what Discord and Slack got right (rooms, threads, search) and strips the rest.</p>

  <p>Built by <a href="https://x.com/ashwinm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="landing-link">Ashwin M.</a> — solopreneur and rubyist. Sabha is an attempt to build an open-source business the bootstrapped way — no VC money, no enterprise sales.</p>

